{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"3387d387-7275-4386-b7f6-86566a432a14","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A derivative describes a curve’s slope at one point. We’ll use the parabola y equals x squared.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Derivative = tangent slope"},{"op":"equation","id":"function","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"f(x)=x^2"},{"op":"axes","id":"axes","region":"right","x":{"min":0,"max":2,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":0,"max":4,"label":"y"}},{"op":"curve","id":"parabola","axes_id":"axes","expr":"x^2","domain":[0,2]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"3387d387-7275-4386-b7f6-86566a432a14","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Focus on the point one, one. The tangent follows the curve’s direction right there.","ops":[{"op":"point","id":"focus","construct":{"kind":"along","element_id":"parabola","t":0.5},"label":"P"},{"op":"line","id":"tangent","construct":{"kind":"tangent_at","curve":"parabola","x":1,"length":0.5},"stroke":"solid","label":"tangent"},{"op":"equation","id":"pointvalue","anchor":{"el":"function","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"P=(1,1)"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"3387d387-7275-4386-b7f6-86566a432a14","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Along this tangent, moving one unit right gives two units of rise. Its slope is two.","ops":[{"op":"curve","id":"run","axes_id":"axes","expr":"1","domain":[1,2]},{"op":"curve","id":"rise","axes_id":"axes","expr":"200*(x-1.99)+1","domain":[1.99,2]},{"op":"equation","id":"slope","anchor":{"el":"pointvalue","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"m=\\frac{\\text{rise}}{\\text{run}}=\\frac{2}{1}=2"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"Does this slope describe the whole parabola, or just its tangent at x = 1?","expected_gist":"It describes the tangent at x = 1; the parabola's slope changes."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"3387d387-7275-4386-b7f6-86566a432a14","step":{"id":"s4","script":"That tangent slope is the derivative at one. The curve’s slope changes elsewhere, so the chosen point matters.","ops":[{"op":"equation","id":"result","anchor":{"el":"slope","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"f'(1)=2"},{"op":"text","id":"local","anchor":{"el":"result","side":"below","gap":0.06},"content":"A local rate of change"}],"checkpoint":null}}
